// This folder is reserved for Phase 2B+ CAD tool implementations.
// Examples: CreateSketchTool, ExtrudeTool, HoleTool, CutTool, FilletTool, etc.
//
// Each tool should:
//   1. Inherit SwToolBase (not required, but recommended for CAD tools)
//   2. Override CanExecute() to validate document type and selection state
//   3. Implement Execute() with try/catch returning ToolResult.Success or ToolResult.Error
//   4. Be registered in AgentCore.RegisterTools()
//
// Do NOT add tools here until Phase 2B is approved.
